[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ケイウンを脱出する準備、できたかい？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you ready to escape from Keiun?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "俺たちはこの後、近くの港から出航する貿易船に\n密航してケイウンを出る",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're going to stow away on a trading ship departing from a nearby port to get out of Keiun."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "自分たちで船を出すと、見つかってしまうからね。\nバレないよう密航でいこう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If we take our own ship, we'll be spotted. Let's keep this on the down-low and stow away."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "は、犯罪でござる……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's... that's a crime..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もちろん、密航先の貿易船の船長には話を付け済みさ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course, I already made arrangements with the captain of the trading ship!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "俺たちは親の反対を押し切って駆け落ちする\n若い恋人たちっていう設定でね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Our cover story is that we're young lovers eloping against our parents' wishes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よくそんな嘘を……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How can you lie so easily..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "諸々承知したでござる……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I understand the plan..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……鬼門、何か不安なことでも？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Kimon, is something troubling you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これは不安……なのであろうか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is this... anxiety I'm feeling?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鏑矢から離れるのが怖いのか？\nもしくは、忍びの在り方を破ってしまうことが？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you afraid of leaving Kaburaya? Or is it breaking from the ninja way that worries you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……拙者は、鏑矢様が戦を起こすのを\n止めたいと思っている",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I want to stop Lady Kaburaya from waging war."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でもそれは、どんな形であれ鏑矢様の命を\n裏切る形になってしまう……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But no matter how I approach it, that means betraying her orders..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここまで永遠と共にやって来たのに、いざケイウンを\n離れるとなると、途端に恐ろしくなって……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've come this far with you, but now that we're actually leaving Keiun, I'm suddenly terrified..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "気持ちは分かるさ。俺も修行で国外に出ることはあった\nけれど、こんな風に出ていくのは初めてだからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I understand how you feel. I've left the country for training before, but never like this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "客観的に見れば、今の俺たちはお尋ね者で、\n逃げていくように思われるかもしれない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "From an outside perspective, we look like wanted criminals running away."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鬼門も、主の命に背いた忍びとして\n周囲から非難されるかもしれない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You might be criticized as a ninja who defied her master."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それでも行こう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But let's go anyway!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "俺たちは鏑矢の幼馴染として、友として、\n彼女を止めるために行くんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're going as Kaburaya's childhood friends, as her friends, to stop her."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鬼門は鏑矢の友として、どうしたいんだ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "As Kaburaya's friend, what do you want to do?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "拙者は……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I want to..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鏑矢様を止めたい！\nそれが命に背くことになっても！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I want to stop Lady Kaburaya! Even if it means defying her orders!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "コウセンによって何かされている可能性があるなら、\nそれを止める術を探したいでござる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If there's a possibility that Kosen has done something to her, I want to find a way to stop it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ！\u3000一緒に行こう。この先どうなるか、\n先行きがまったく見えなくて不安ばかりだけれどね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! Let's go together. I can't see what lies ahead and I'm filled with anxiety, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "きっとなんとかなるでござるよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everything will work out somehow!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。俺も少し不安だったけれど、\n一人じゃないってだけで心強いよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. I was feeling anxious too, but just knowing I'm not alone gives me strength."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鏑矢様のため、共に頑張るでござる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's do our best together for Lady Kaburaya's sake!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "む、この足音は、千歳殿！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, those footsteps... Lady Chitose!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……行くのですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You're leaving."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。止めても無駄だよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. It's pointless to try and stop us."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では……こちらをお持ちください。\n少量ですが、食料です……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then... please take this. It's not much, but it's food..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "千歳殿、かたじけない！\n大切に大切にいただきまする！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lady Chitose, thank you! I'll treasure every bite!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……私にできることは、ここまでです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...This is all I can do."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この時間が終わったら、あなたがたは、私の敵……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "After this moment, you will be... my enemies..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鏑矢様に仇なすあなたがたを……\n私は……見逃すわけには……いきません",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Those who oppose Lady Kaburaya... I cannot... let you go unpunished..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ……それでいい。\n今までありがとう、千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I know... That's how it has to be. Thank you for everything, Chitose."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "また戻ってくる。必ず。約束だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll come back. I promise."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……時間だな。行こう、鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...It's time. Let's go, Kimon."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "承知",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……散った花は、戻らぬもの。\nどうか……お達者で",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Scattered petals never return. Please... stay safe."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]